  "details": "# Issue:\nThe tooltip for when you want to switch to Default View is the same for when you want to switch to Compact View.\nThis does not effect all of these buttons, here is a list of which ones are effected:\n- Worlds Tab: Default / Compact View buttons on the Banners\n- Avatars Tab: all Default / Compact View buttons\n- Social Tab: all of the Default / Compact View buttons\nHere is a list of which ones work fine:\n- Worlds Tab: Default / Compact View buttons above the scroll bar (only appear when you scrolled down a bit)\n- Worlds Tab: all Default / Compact View buttons in the \"My Worlds\" section\n# Attachments:\nIn the first picture you can see the tooltip working as intended and showing that I could switch to Compact View, in the second picture I'm already in Compact View but the button still shows that I could switch to it:",
